(text "CHARGE-PERMIT-01 v0.1 - logical latch candidate, NOT a complete charger shutdown" (at 25.4 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "41f326a0-367e-57ab-8c80-da4caf0f3a35"))
(text "FAULT_BUS_N LOW clears Q even with ARM HIGH. Releasing fault alone does not re-arm.\nD and PRE tied HIGH. Only a new ARM rising edge after reset recovery may set Q. Q-bar intentionally unused.\nExternal fault sources / MCU revoke must sink or release; never drive shared bus HIGH." (at 25.4 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "df065ae8-0cfd-50dd-b219-4bca92bdd51f"))
(text "AUX 3.0..3.6V proposal; supervisor falling nominal 3.07V. Below IC valid rails, outputs are NOT guaranteed.\nNo MCU/watchdog/INA300/charger actuator here. PCB, timing, transient and deep-brownout qualification are open." (at 25.4 274.32 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f9fb2807-eddd-5f9f-8a6a-2cd3ca081d9d"))
